{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03499","headline":"伤裴录事丧子 · 王勃","name":"伤裴录事丧子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兰阶霜候早，松露穸台深。\n魄散珠胎没，芳销玉树沈。\n露文曦宿草，烟照惨平林。\n芝焚空欢息，流恨满籝金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王勃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03499.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03499","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}